GRADUATION

579
00:33:20,832 --> 00:33:23,793
<i>We will now begin the graduation ceremony.</i>

580
00:33:24,919 --> 00:33:28,463
<i>When you hear your name called,
please step forward,</i>

581
00:33:28,464 --> 00:33:30,966
<i>call out the person you have feelings for,</i>

582
00:33:30,967 --> 00:33:33,386
<i>and confess your true feelings to them.</i>

583
00:33:35,513 --> 00:33:39,016
- I'm nervous.
- <i>First up, Sharan.</i>

584
00:33:39,017 --> 00:33:39,851
Yes.

585
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:51,863
First of all, I'd like to thank you all
for the past two weeks.

586
00:33:53,448 --> 00:33:55,116
Doing things in a group setting

587
00:33:56,284 --> 00:33:58,619
has never felt comfortable to me,
to be honest.

588
00:33:59,370 --> 00:34:00,246
But then,

589
00:34:01,706 --> 00:34:02,957
I didn't expect to…

590
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:07,002
I didn't think I could get along
with anyone at first,

591
00:34:07,003 --> 00:34:08,046
but then I did.

592
00:34:09,630 --> 00:34:12,258
And in the end, I think I learned a lot.

593
00:34:14,302 --> 00:34:17,345
And as far as romance goes, you know,

594
00:34:17,346 --> 00:34:20,308
I didn't think
I could find it here at all.

595
00:34:23,019 --> 00:34:26,063
I think, emotionally, I felt so unstable.

596
00:34:26,064 --> 00:34:29,484
But now, I feel I'm much stronger,
thanks to all of you.

597
00:34:31,944 --> 00:34:33,696
So, I'm glad I met you all.

598
00:34:35,114 --> 00:34:37,909
This is something I'll never, ever forget.

599
00:34:38,534 --> 00:34:40,410
So, at this graduation ceremony,

600
00:34:40,411 --> 00:34:41,788
I want to convey my love

601
00:34:42,455 --> 00:34:44,040
without holding anything back.

602
00:34:45,208 --> 00:34:46,250
So…

603
00:34:50,171 --> 00:34:51,005
Tai-chan.

604
00:34:51,923 --> 00:34:53,049
Yes.

605
00:35:20,326 --> 00:35:21,536
From the first day,

606
00:35:22,203 --> 00:35:24,956
you were the one
I ended up talking to the most.

607
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:29,293
And gradually, I started to like you.

608
00:35:30,586 --> 00:35:33,464
But then, I have these flaws,
you might call them.

609
00:35:35,007 --> 00:35:37,093
Like, because I liked you so much,

610
00:35:37,718 --> 00:35:39,053
it made me jealous.

611
00:35:40,054 --> 00:35:41,973
And I would cry all the time.

612
00:35:42,723 --> 00:35:45,726
But I decided I'm not giving up.
This is my last chance.

613
00:35:46,602 --> 00:35:49,354
This is the first time in my entire life

614
00:35:49,355 --> 00:35:52,191
that I am the one who confesses.

615
00:35:54,152 --> 00:35:55,194
So…

616
00:35:56,946 --> 00:35:58,239
please go out with me.

617
00:36:02,618 --> 00:36:03,744
- First of all…
- Yeah.

618
00:36:04,579 --> 00:36:06,705
…thank you for sharing
your feelings with me.

619
00:36:06,706 --> 00:36:07,540
Yeah.

620
00:36:08,624 --> 00:36:11,376
- I was also interested in you.
- Mmm.

621
00:36:11,377 --> 00:36:14,255
- And you and I went through a lot.
- We did.

622
00:36:14,797 --> 00:36:18,133
<i>Like, you got mad at me and cried. Yeah.</i>

623
00:36:18,134 --> 00:36:21,511
I always hoped that you would change.

624
00:36:21,512 --> 00:36:23,347
- I also need to change myself…
- Right.

625
00:36:23,931 --> 00:36:25,099
…in many ways.

626
00:36:26,058 --> 00:36:28,727
And, at some point,
your expression started to brighten,

627
00:36:28,728 --> 00:36:30,604
and it seemed like you changed a lot.

628
00:36:30,605 --> 00:36:31,939
I definitely noticed.

629
00:36:39,655 --> 00:36:41,656
But, you know, mmm…

630
00:36:41,657 --> 00:36:43,284
- I still think…
- Yeah?

631
00:36:44,577 --> 00:36:46,662
- …there's someone I can't give up on.
- Ah.

632
00:36:47,163 --> 00:36:48,539
- So in the end…
- Sure.

633
00:36:49,415 --> 00:36:53,211
…I want to give my all
and share my love with her.

634
00:36:53,878 --> 00:36:55,963
- That's what I feel. Mmm.
- Okay.

635
00:36:56,464 --> 00:36:59,216
- But thank you for coming into my life.
- Likewise.

636
00:36:59,217 --> 00:37:01,093
- I'm sorry.
- No, it's okay.

637
00:37:01,802 --> 00:37:04,221
- Totally fine. I should thank you.
- Oh?

638
00:37:04,222 --> 00:37:06,348
- I got to open my heart to you.
- Ah.

639
00:37:06,349 --> 00:37:08,142
And I'm not crying.

640
00:37:21,197 --> 00:37:23,782
- <i>Wow, look at Sharan's face.</i>
- <i>So nice.</i>

641
00:37:23,783 --> 00:37:25,367
- Wonderful.
- Sharan was great.

642
00:37:25,368 --> 00:37:27,160
Well done, Sharan.

643
00:37:27,161 --> 00:37:29,038
She's grown so much.

644
00:37:29,664 --> 00:37:31,665
<i>She didn't cry at all.</i>

645
00:37:31,666 --> 00:37:33,000
<i>Next up is…</i>

646
00:37:34,543 --> 00:37:35,461
<i>Kamaken.</i>

647
00:37:36,671 --> 00:37:37,505
Yes.

648
00:37:48,724 --> 00:37:49,600
First of all,

649
00:37:50,726 --> 00:37:53,187
I joined much later.

650
00:37:55,648 --> 00:37:59,235
So I was worried
about whether I could fall in love.

651
00:38:00,319 --> 00:38:01,195
But then,

652
00:38:02,530 --> 00:38:07,075
I felt more youthful and passionate here
than I did when I was actually in school,

653
00:38:07,076 --> 00:38:08,160
in my younger days.

654
00:38:09,620 --> 00:38:11,163
To me, this truly was

655
00:38:12,415 --> 00:38:15,668
an invaluable experience in my life.

656
00:38:16,794 --> 00:38:19,338
I got to interact with a lot of people

657
00:38:20,256 --> 00:38:22,049
and saw different approaches to life

658
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:26,137
and learned what being cool
actually means, as a man.

659
00:38:27,555 --> 00:38:29,598
I did everything I could.

660
00:38:32,476 --> 00:38:33,644
And during it all,

661
00:38:35,896 --> 00:38:37,606
while I was here at this school,

662
00:38:38,899 --> 00:38:40,526
I fell in love with a girl.

663
00:38:41,027 --> 00:38:41,986
Rinrin.

664
00:38:46,490 --> 00:38:47,407
Yes.

665
00:38:47,408 --> 00:38:49,034
- Oh?
- Oh, she smiled!

666
00:38:49,035 --> 00:38:50,202
Look at that!

667
00:39:16,020 --> 00:39:16,937
Rinrin.

668
00:39:18,356 --> 00:39:21,692
You were the first person
to ask me out on a date after I got here.

669
00:39:23,444 --> 00:39:25,529
<i>That date was so much fun.</i>

670
00:39:27,156 --> 00:39:28,449
<i>I was so attracted to you.</i>

671
00:39:28,991 --> 00:39:31,369
On the outside, you're so <i>gyaru.</i>

672
00:39:32,578 --> 00:39:34,162
It's intimidating.

673
00:39:34,163 --> 00:39:35,581
That's how I felt at first.

674
00:39:37,541 --> 00:39:39,752
But watching how you face things head-on…

675
00:39:42,171 --> 00:39:44,340
made me fall for you so quickly.

676
00:39:47,968 --> 00:39:51,639
I still have a lot to work on
so I can mature.

677
00:39:52,848 --> 00:39:53,682
Mmm.

678
00:39:54,558 --> 00:39:57,103
But you made me realize
that age doesn't matter.

679
00:39:58,938 --> 00:40:00,106
And with you,

680
00:40:01,690 --> 00:40:02,775
I want to…

681
00:40:03,984 --> 00:40:06,862
keep growing as a person by your side.

682
00:40:08,614 --> 00:40:11,075
So, please, go out with me.

683
00:40:22,420 --> 00:40:24,671
First of all, was it one week?

684
00:40:24,672 --> 00:40:26,297
- Yeah.
- Thank you.

685
00:40:26,298 --> 00:40:27,758
Um, how do I put this?

686
00:40:28,759 --> 00:40:33,555
Since I lived in Miyagi Prefecture when
the Great East Japan Earthquake happened…

687
00:40:33,556 --> 00:40:34,390
Yeah?

688
00:40:35,391 --> 00:40:38,268
- …I knew some of the people that died.
- Right.

689
00:40:38,269 --> 00:40:41,188
Since then,
I've had trouble with my friends,

690
00:40:42,481 --> 00:40:45,400
and I got into fist fights
and stuff like that.

691
00:40:45,401 --> 00:40:47,361
I've dealt with a lot of pain.

692
00:40:48,237 --> 00:40:51,698
But after what I've been through,
I came here and met you.

693
00:40:51,699 --> 00:40:53,032
How do I say this?

694
00:40:53,033 --> 00:40:55,870
I couldn't be myself before,
but now I feel like I can.

695
00:40:59,498 --> 00:41:02,168
This was the first time I felt that way.

696
00:41:05,337 --> 00:41:08,174
I kept watching you
and saw how you always…

697
00:41:09,758 --> 00:41:11,385
try your best at everything,

698
00:41:12,428 --> 00:41:14,638
and I found myself attracted to you.

699
00:41:16,932 --> 00:41:18,809
And before I knew it, I had a crush.

700
00:41:20,853 --> 00:41:23,104
So, yes, I'd be happy to go out with you.

701
00:41:23,105 --> 00:41:25,774
- I look forward to it.
- Likewise.

702
00:41:27,485 --> 00:41:29,736
Oh, they did it!

703
00:41:29,737 --> 00:41:32,907
- Yeah!
- Oh my gosh, so great!

704
00:41:34,617 --> 00:41:36,784
- <i>They look great.</i>
- <i>Whoa!</i>

705
00:41:36,785 --> 00:41:39,078
I got lipstick on you.

706
00:41:39,079 --> 00:41:40,247
Yay!

707
00:41:40,748 --> 00:41:41,873
Congrats, Kamaken!

708
00:41:41,874 --> 00:41:43,166
- Congrats!
- Thank you!

709
00:41:43,167 --> 00:41:45,585
- <i>We were worried, weren't we?</i>
- <i>So happy for them.</i>

710
00:41:45,586 --> 00:41:47,378
<i>Definitely.</i>

711
00:41:47,379 --> 00:41:48,797
So manly.

712
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:51,926
- Thank you.
- I was so nervous.

713
00:41:57,973 --> 00:41:58,974
<i>Next up is…</i>

714
00:41:59,975 --> 00:42:01,185
<i>Kahochi.</i>

715
00:42:02,561 --> 00:42:03,479
Yes.

716
00:42:09,109 --> 00:42:11,027
I mean, like…

717
00:42:11,028 --> 00:42:14,573
Mmm, I made a friend
that I can now call my bestie.

718
00:42:15,074 --> 00:42:18,994
And I also have some big sisters here
that I can talk to forever.

719
00:42:19,954 --> 00:42:21,413
And all the boys are kind.

720
00:42:23,624 --> 00:42:27,085
Mmm, at the very end of this,

721
00:42:27,086 --> 00:42:29,420
I found someone that I like.

722
00:42:29,421 --> 00:42:32,258
So today,
I want to properly tell him how I feel.

723
00:42:33,384 --> 00:42:36,262
And that man is Kazuma, of course.

724
00:42:36,845 --> 00:42:37,763
Yes.

