969
00:59:41,035 --> 00:59:43,495
- <i>So, what is she going to do?</i>
- <i>Make up your mind.</i>

970
00:59:43,496 --> 00:59:45,498
- <i>It comes down to her decision.</i>
- <i>Right.</i>

971
01:00:09,022 --> 01:00:09,981
Rune.

972
01:00:12,233 --> 01:00:13,693
I must interrupt.

973
01:00:19,949 --> 01:00:21,784
I have to interrupt you as well.

974
01:00:24,829 --> 01:00:25,788
Bring it on.

975
01:00:48,728 --> 01:00:52,023
Mimi, first,
thank you for coming into my life.

976
01:00:52,857 --> 01:00:54,776
You made my life at school so great.

977
01:00:56,986 --> 01:00:59,781
When you first walked into the classroom,

978
01:01:01,282 --> 01:01:04,494
I seriously thought
you were just a stubborn girl.

979
01:01:05,953 --> 01:01:07,121
That was my impression.

980
01:01:09,082 --> 01:01:12,250
<i>At that time, I just wasn't interested</i>

981
01:01:12,251 --> 01:01:14,420
<i>or developing feelings for you at all.</i>

982
01:01:15,171 --> 01:01:16,380
<i>But the more I got to know you,</i>

983
01:01:16,381 --> 01:01:18,675
the more I found myself attracted to you.

984
01:01:20,677 --> 01:01:22,679
Before long, I was crazy about you.

985
01:01:25,181 --> 01:01:26,974
The way you care about your family…

986
01:01:28,851 --> 01:01:30,812
I can see how much you cherish them.

987
01:01:31,813 --> 01:01:33,146
I'm the same way.

988
01:01:33,147 --> 01:01:35,525
And I like that kind
and gentle side of you.

989
01:01:37,860 --> 01:01:39,778
When you're angry, you show it.

990
01:01:39,779 --> 01:01:41,655
When you're sad, you cry.

991
01:01:41,656 --> 01:01:43,324
I've seen so many sides of you.

992
01:01:45,326 --> 01:01:47,787
And now, I like you very much.

993
01:01:51,499 --> 01:01:53,126
You always told me

994
01:01:54,043 --> 01:01:56,254
that I'm your hero.

995
01:01:58,506 --> 01:02:01,718
But from now on,
I don't want to just be your hero.

996
01:02:04,554 --> 01:02:05,888
I want to be your man.

997
01:02:06,806 --> 01:02:08,224
I want you to be with me.

998
01:02:09,142 --> 01:02:11,561
I care about you. Please go out with me.

999
01:02:23,781 --> 01:02:27,201
First of all,
for everything so far, I thank you.

1000
01:02:27,744 --> 01:02:29,704
I've told you so many times
that I like you.

1001
01:02:30,872 --> 01:02:33,623
I wrote "I like Mimi so much"
on the beach,

1002
01:02:33,624 --> 01:02:35,001
and it was the truth.

1003
01:02:35,752 --> 01:02:36,586
And, well,

1004
01:02:37,086 --> 01:02:39,338
as we spent time living together,

1005
01:02:40,173 --> 01:02:42,842
my feelings for you
kept growing every day.

1006
01:02:43,426 --> 01:02:46,721
<i>Yeah. There are the things
we talked about at the beach,</i>

1007
01:02:47,513 --> 01:02:50,141
<i>like our age difference and our futures.</i>

1008
01:02:51,017 --> 01:02:54,228
Honestly, I still think
that those things are irrelevant,

1009
01:02:54,729 --> 01:02:57,272
and I'm going to prove that
to you, for sure.

1010
01:02:57,273 --> 01:02:58,149
Mmm-hmm.

1011
01:02:59,066 --> 01:03:00,859
I'm a pretty clumsy person,

1012
01:03:00,860 --> 01:03:03,571
so you do laugh at me a lot, but…

1013
01:03:05,114 --> 01:03:09,452
despite that, you still made me feel
like I want you by my side forever.

1014
01:03:09,952 --> 01:03:10,787
Mmm.

1015
01:03:11,579 --> 01:03:12,914
I'll get straight to the point.

1016
01:03:13,748 --> 01:03:15,374
I want you to come with me.

1017
01:03:16,334 --> 01:03:18,211
I will definitely make you happy.

1018
01:03:19,337 --> 01:03:20,171
That's all.

1019
01:03:31,682 --> 01:03:32,809
Um, Mimi.

1020
01:03:34,727 --> 01:03:37,354
You're probably a very strong woman,

1021
01:03:37,355 --> 01:03:40,357
but there must be a side of you
that you don't show others.

1022
01:03:40,358 --> 01:03:42,485
That was my first impression of you.

1023
01:03:43,069 --> 01:03:46,030
And that was the side of you
I was most curious about.

1024
01:03:47,073 --> 01:03:50,159
<i>And the more we talked,
and the more time we spent together,</i>

1025
01:03:51,202 --> 01:03:53,621
<i>I noticed something
that I thought was wonderful.</i>

1026
01:03:54,914 --> 01:03:58,835
<i>You took each of us seriously
and considered romance with us earnestly.</i>

1027
01:04:00,253 --> 01:04:01,795
I thought that with you,

1028
01:04:01,796 --> 01:04:06,092
I could have the relationship
that I've been searching for,

1029
01:04:06,592 --> 01:04:08,553
and that's how I fell in love.

1030
01:04:10,680 --> 01:04:12,472
You gave a great first impression.

1031
01:04:12,473 --> 01:04:17,353
On day one, you were strong,
beautiful, and very mature.

1032
01:04:18,646 --> 01:04:20,773
But I also know there's a vulnerable side.

1033
01:04:21,399 --> 01:04:25,735
I believe I am best suited to listen
and understand that side of you as well.

1034
01:04:25,736 --> 01:04:28,738
And I don't mean
just the guys at this school.

1035
01:04:28,739 --> 01:04:31,575
Even in the real world,
I will understand you the best,

1036
01:04:31,576 --> 01:04:34,328
and I hope for the opportunity
to support you.

1037
01:04:35,288 --> 01:04:37,123
Please let me show you that support.

1038
01:04:37,999 --> 01:04:39,166
Please go out with me.

1039
01:04:56,434 --> 01:04:58,977
What? She's deciding in the moment?

1040
01:04:58,978 --> 01:05:01,271
- She's thinking.
- Oh, I'm so nervous!

1041
01:05:01,272 --> 01:05:02,397
Go for it, Mimi.

1042
01:05:02,398 --> 01:05:04,275
- Overcome your trauma.
- That's right.

1043
01:05:39,352 --> 01:05:41,270
I'm sorry, one second.

1044
01:05:48,319 --> 01:05:49,487
Can I start with Maru?

1045
01:05:51,906 --> 01:05:53,281
With you, Maru,

1046
01:05:53,282 --> 01:05:56,618
as we talked, I thought
that you were very understanding

1047
01:05:56,619 --> 01:05:58,703
of what I do for a living.

1048
01:05:58,704 --> 01:06:01,623
We've talked so much,
and you are always thoughtful about it.

1049
01:06:01,624 --> 01:06:03,876
I always thought
that was very sweet of you.

1050
01:06:04,627 --> 01:06:05,711
But, you know…

1051
01:06:07,463 --> 01:06:09,673
…I don't think I can be

1052
01:06:09,674 --> 01:06:12,426
that understanding
of the work that you do.

1053
01:06:15,012 --> 01:06:16,596
So…

1054
01:06:16,597 --> 01:06:19,141
…I cannot return the feelings
that you have for me.

1055
01:06:20,393 --> 01:06:22,103
- Thank you.
- I'm so sorry.

1056
01:06:36,325 --> 01:06:37,242
Tai-chan, may I?

1057
01:06:37,243 --> 01:06:38,077
Mmm.

1058
01:06:40,413 --> 01:06:41,997
Yeah, so, Tai-chan,

1059
01:06:41,998 --> 01:06:43,873
when I first met you,

1060
01:06:43,874 --> 01:06:46,751
my impression was that you looked unusual

1061
01:06:46,752 --> 01:06:48,670
and that you were only 22.

1062
01:06:48,671 --> 01:06:51,424
And you had already flunked Part 1.

1063
01:06:52,550 --> 01:06:54,092
I was like, "Why is he here?"

1064
01:06:54,093 --> 01:06:56,929
I had a very negative impression of you.

1065
01:06:57,513 --> 01:06:58,347
Mmm.

1066
01:06:58,848 --> 01:07:02,559
I just saw you
as someone who was very young.

1067
01:07:02,560 --> 01:07:04,728
And then we started going on one-on-ones,

1068
01:07:04,729 --> 01:07:07,397
and the way you express yourself
is much more mature

1069
01:07:07,398 --> 01:07:09,524
than a typical 22-year-old.

1070
01:07:09,525 --> 01:07:11,860
You were the most… How do I say it?

1071
01:07:11,861 --> 01:07:15,156
My heart just naturally fluttered the most
when I was with you.

1072
01:07:17,867 --> 01:07:18,868
But, still…

1073
01:07:21,078 --> 01:07:22,538
I don't know, I…

1074
01:07:23,039 --> 01:07:27,043
I guess I'm just not
the type of person who takes risks.

1075
01:07:29,670 --> 01:07:31,964
I know how strongly you feel,
but I'm sorry.

1076
01:07:32,548 --> 01:07:33,382
Thank you.

1077
01:07:41,515 --> 01:07:42,391
Rune, may I?

1078
01:07:42,975 --> 01:07:43,809
Of course.

1079
01:07:47,021 --> 01:07:50,691
Hmm, when I… first met you here,

1080
01:07:51,901 --> 01:07:55,738
I got the impression from you
that you were a very good listener.

1081
01:07:56,947 --> 01:07:59,199
And when
the missing meal incident happened,

1082
01:07:59,200 --> 01:08:00,868
you were the first to notice.

1083
01:08:02,078 --> 01:08:05,038
If you hadn't suggested
that we eat in the kitchen,

1084
01:08:05,039 --> 01:08:07,207
to be completely honest with you,

1085
01:08:07,208 --> 01:08:09,752
I don't think
I would be standing here right now.

1086
01:08:10,920 --> 01:08:12,630
And from that point on, you know,

1087
01:08:13,756 --> 01:08:16,716
I was somehow able
to hang out with the other girls.

1088
01:08:16,717 --> 01:08:20,553
And as we continued sharing
this experience and living together,

1089
01:08:20,554 --> 01:08:23,556
we had our one-on-ones
and our overnight date,

1090
01:08:23,557 --> 01:08:26,726
and I thought that it was very admirable

1091
01:08:26,727 --> 01:08:28,978
that you are such a sincere person.

1092
01:08:28,979 --> 01:08:31,397
And the thing that made me the happiest

1093
01:08:31,398 --> 01:08:33,733
was that you were always
the first to notice

1094
01:08:33,734 --> 01:08:35,277
when I was in trouble.

1095
01:08:42,910 --> 01:08:45,246
I'm already 29 years old,

1096
01:08:45,746 --> 01:08:49,791
but I still have a childish side,
as I'm sure everyone knows.

1097
01:08:49,792 --> 01:08:50,626
I'm still…

1098
01:08:51,127 --> 01:08:53,128
How do I say it?

1099
01:08:53,129 --> 01:08:55,840
I want to support someone,
but I also want to…

1100
01:08:56,632 --> 01:08:58,049
be supported.

1101
01:08:58,050 --> 01:08:59,135
And so, I…

1102
01:08:59,885 --> 01:09:01,970
want to support you, Rune.

1103
01:09:01,971 --> 01:09:04,807
And I want you to be the one
who supports me too.

1104
01:09:07,977 --> 01:09:08,811
Thank you.

1105
01:09:13,232 --> 01:09:16,276
Whoa…

1106
01:09:16,277 --> 01:09:18,028
Did that just happen?

1107
01:09:29,748 --> 01:09:32,041
<i>I had absolutely no idea.</i>

1108
01:09:32,042 --> 01:09:35,129
<i>Me neither,
but I didn't think she would choose Rune.</i>

1109
01:09:37,965 --> 01:09:38,882
<i>But, you know,</i>

1110
01:09:38,883 --> 01:09:41,760
<i>love isn't just about
how well people flirt.</i>

1111
01:09:47,975 --> 01:09:48,809
Thank you.

1112
01:09:53,689 --> 01:09:54,856
Thank you.

1113
01:09:54,857 --> 01:09:57,359
Tai-chan!

1114
01:09:58,986 --> 01:10:02,030
I mean, can he get another confession?
To Sharan?

1115
01:10:02,031 --> 01:10:03,616
Tai-chan.

1116
01:10:05,618 --> 01:10:08,037
Kazuma, you were so cool.

1117
01:10:08,621 --> 01:10:11,415
<i>That concludes our graduation ceremony.</i>

1118
01:10:12,082 --> 01:10:14,459
- <i>So it's over!</i>
- Hey, Sharan. Sharan.

1119
01:10:14,460 --> 01:10:16,336
<i>Oh, go for it!</i>

1120
01:10:16,337 --> 01:10:19,131
- Thank you.
- <i>It's fine, go for it. It's okay.</i>

1121
01:10:19,632 --> 01:10:20,798
<i>Maybe it's starting?</i>

1122
01:10:20,799 --> 01:10:22,759
- <i>I hope that's true.</i>
- <i>I hope so too.</i>

1123
01:10:22,760 --> 01:10:26,179
- <i>It's okay to try, right?</i>
- <i>Yeah, it is! Sure, sure.</i>

1124
01:10:26,180 --> 01:10:27,972
<i>It's fine to start something new.</i>

1125
01:10:27,973 --> 01:10:29,474
- <i>It's fine.</i>
- <i>Totally.</i>

1126
01:10:29,475 --> 01:10:31,851
- You did it.
- Little sister. You did well.

1127
01:10:31,852 --> 01:10:33,604
- You too, Kazuma.
- Same to you.

1128
01:10:53,290 --> 01:10:55,292
BADLY IN LOVE
GRADUATION

1129
01:10:57,169 --> 01:11:00,004
- <i>Oh, I'm starting to feel sad.</i>
- <i>It's bittersweet.</i>

1130
01:11:00,005 --> 01:11:01,714
- <i>I know.</i>
- <i>I wonder why.</i>

1131
01:11:01,715 --> 01:11:04,134
<i>- Because it's ending?</i>
- <i>Yeah, it's coming to an end.</i>

1132
01:11:09,515 --> 01:11:11,432
KAHOCHI
OKINAWA

1133
01:11:11,433 --> 01:11:13,269
SARA

1134
01:11:15,271 --> 01:11:17,188
SHARAN

1135
01:11:17,189 --> 01:11:19,107
SGS MOTORCYCLE CLUB
AYACHERU

1136
01:11:19,108 --> 01:11:21,025
RINRIN

1137
01:11:21,026 --> 01:11:22,944
FIRST OF ALL,
THANKS RYOPI FOR EVERYTHING

1138
01:11:22,945 --> 01:11:24,862
LOVE
KAZUMA

1139
01:11:24,863 --> 01:11:26,781
REPRESENTING KABUKICHO!!

1140
01:11:26,782 --> 01:11:28,617
TAI-CHAN - NOTORIOUS
SAFETY FIRST - FOREST SAUNA

1141
01:11:30,619 --> 01:11:32,454
KAMAKEN

1142
01:12:34,308 --> 01:12:39,438
LOVE

1143
01:12:40,147 --> 01:12:42,106
You know, they really go for it.

1144
01:12:42,107 --> 01:12:44,317
They face each other head-on
and lock horns.

1145
01:12:44,318 --> 01:12:45,276
- Right.
- Mmm.

1146
01:12:45,277 --> 01:12:48,404
That's what makes them
so wonderful and exciting.

1147
01:12:48,405 --> 01:12:50,782
It inspires us too,
to live our lives in earnest.

1148
01:12:50,783 --> 01:12:53,034
- Yes. 100%.
- That's how it feels.

1149
01:12:53,035 --> 01:12:54,660
- Yeah, truly.
- Mmm.

1150
01:12:54,661 --> 01:12:57,205
I miss them already!

1151
01:12:57,206 --> 01:12:58,289
- Me too.
- So much.

1152
01:12:58,290 --> 01:12:59,291
I miss them too.

1153
01:13:46,505 --> 01:13:48,215
<i>Please repeat the year.</i>

1154
01:13:48,715 --> 01:13:49,550
Okay.
